 s a great time!\n\n📱 **Don’t forget to join our WhatsApp group** – 
 [CLICK HERE!](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc?mode=ac_t)\
 n\n\\#\\#\\# ⚠️ Notes\n\n* Please don’t just “show up” without R
 SVPing — seating is limited\, and teams need to be balanced.\n* Occasion
 ally\, the organizer may need to rearrange teams if one is *too stacked* (
