 pen — events can be canceled or adjusted\, so keep an eye out for update
 s.\n*\n\n📩 **Questions?**\nContact **Colleen**\, your organizer\, by po
 sting on the event page.\n\nTrivia starts at 8p.m.\, but we meet at 7:30p.
 m. - ask the staff for colleen's tables. **everyone MUST spend at least $1
 0 (plus tax and tip) on food/drinks.**\n\n**1ST TIMERS MUST E-TRANSFER A $
